    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Awesome Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Responsive and precise 2D gameplay with an emphasis on movement-enhancing abilities. Double &amp; triple jumps, a wall jump, teleport dash and shape shifting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227320/extras/7edb3f47040274404ecec18e5b6cfd43.poster.avif?t=1755022578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227320/extras/7edb3f47040274404ecec18e5b6cfd43.webm?t=1755022578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Abilities and Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A set of magical weapons, each upgradeable and with different trade-offs, selectable via an old-school ring menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227320/extras/c0871c0438ded5d99e7c46b887bfe79b.poster.avif?t=1755022578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227320/extras/c0871c0438ded5d99e7c46b887bfe79b.webm?t=1755022578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Excellent Level Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six beautiful and unique levels - explore the many rooms of the castle, its mysterious mine or the beautiful outdoor garden!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227320/extras/32d992c7f7bb8bd5389ba297f864a3d7.avif?t=1755022578\" /></div>Secret rooms, treasure chests and hidden tablets with lore to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fast travel system with teleport gates that make backtracking much more convenient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227320/extras/f19458ee7f89ff9aec8308042ac96e3e.avif?t=1755022578\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An interesting skill tree with a mix of status upgrades, temporary buffs and passive skills such as automatic healing and HP siphoning. Numerous side quests, a shop to buy much-needed potions, and an ingredient collection system to unlock special parts of the skill tree!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Music and Sound</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy beautiful music and sound effects created by Dynamedion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a world with unique music for the six sections of Signiverux, each carefully designed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be entertained by the sound effects thoughtfully put together, while you explore, fight and learn about the mysteries of this game world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many, many thanks to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Andreas Hammann - Music Composer &amp; Sound Designer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steffen Brinkmann - Music Composer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Awesome Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Responsive and precise 2D gameplay with an emphasis on movement-enhancing abilities. Double &amp; triple jumps, a wall jump, teleport dash and shape shifting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227320/extras/7edb3f47040274404ecec18e5b6cfd43.poster.avif?t=1755022578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227320/extras/7edb3f47040274404ecec18e5b6cfd43.webm?t=1755022578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Abilities and Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A set of magical weapons, each upgradeable and with different trade-offs, selectable via an old-school ring menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227320/extras/c0871c0438ded5d99e7c46b887bfe79b.poster.avif?t=1755022578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227320/extras/c0871c0438ded5d99e7c46b887bfe79b.webm?t=1755022578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Excellent Level Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six beautiful and unique levels - explore the many rooms of the castle, its mysterious mine or the beautiful outdoor garden!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227320/extras/32d992c7f7bb8bd5389ba297f864a3d7.avif?t=1755022578\" /></div>Secret rooms, treasure chests and hidden tablets with lore to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fast travel system with teleport gates that make backtracking much more convenient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227320/extras/f19458ee7f89ff9aec8308042ac96e3e.avif?t=1755022578\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An interesting skill tree with a mix of status upgrades, temporary buffs and passive skills such as automatic healing and HP siphoning. Numerous side quests, a shop to buy much-needed potions, and an ingredient collection system to unlock special parts of the skill tree!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Music and Sound</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy beautiful music and sound effects created by Dynamedion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a world with unique music for the six sections of Signiverux, each carefully designed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be entertained by the sound effects thoughtfully put together, while you explore, fight and learn about the mysteries of this game world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many, many thanks to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Andreas Hammann - Music Composer &amp; Sound Designer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steffen Brinkmann - Music Composer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Signiverux is a Metroidvania-inspired action adventure with fluid gameplay and detailed graphics. Explore the depths of a mysterious castle in search for a way back home, enjoy fast ability progressions, search for powerful magic upgrades and grow your character by expanding the skill tree.",
